node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
.astro/
*.log
.DS_Store

# The Claude harness (.claude/ + CLAUDE.md) IS committed here — navori dogfoods
# itself. The "never commit .claude/ or CLAUDE.md" rule is scoped to the Bonum
# repos only; everywhere else the harness is version-controlled.
# Only machine-local and transient bits stay out:
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
# Ephemeral subagent handoffs (audits, research, solutions, reviews). navori's
# own CUBO_A lists this as never-commit; the file was missing the entry, so a
# session's artifacts leaked into git. Session STATE lives in progress/ (root),
# which IS versioned on purpose.
.claude/progress/
# mtime baseline for the managed-drift watcher — machine-local timing state
.claude/.managed-drift-stamp
# Per-session tally for the routing watcher (spec 0020): which files the main
# thread wrote and whether it delegated. Machine-local and per-session.
.claude/.routing-watch/

# Codex session artifacts are machine-local; the managed config, agents and
# hooks under `.codex/` plus AGENTS.md are versioned with this self-hosted harness.
.codex/progress/

# navori-ai runtime state in dev/test repos
.navori/

# navori.config.json is the checked-in source of truth (even when dogfooding).

# build artifacts
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# Residuo local del plugin `codegraph`, retirado del motor el 2026-09-15: el
# binario dejó su índice SQLite en `.codegraph/` y se auto-ignora salvo su
# propio `.gitignore`, que sin esta línea aparece como `??`. navori ya no
# gestiona esta entrada (salió de `CUBO_A_ENTRIES`); esta es de este repo, y
# sobra el día que el directorio se borre.
.codegraph/
